Backport of upstream libwebp commit 220e3d311aad7da6060c3a7380e04a0cdd113a30
("rescaler_sse2: quiet spurious int sanitizer warnings", 2026-08-06), which
is after the v1.6.0 release zupix pins. _mm_set_epi32() takes int
arguments; the casts it adds silence GCC 16's -Woverflow warning on
ROUNDER (2^31), which R CMD check reports as significant. The hunk in
ProcessRow_SSE2 is re-applied by hand: 1.6.0 formats that function's
parameters differently. No change in behaviour.

